  "ingredients": [
    "1 (3 pound) spaghetti squash",
    "1 cup water, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Carefully cut stem end off spaghetti squash. Poke a few small slits in squash in a dotted line where you plan to slice squash.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bhOz46e_CgGTXpv4xgCcNfuPUkg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282385-microwave-spaghetti-squash-ddmfs-step2-9ce3af38f7134560a83df529e309b750.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282385/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Carefully cut between the slits until squash is cut in half. Scoop out seeds and pulp.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GHpVzRFqGP0CEQpLsz1s_Sx8mHk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282385-microwave-spaghetti-squash-ddmfs-step4-5782de073eb94126a643cbc1815e3fd2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282385/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place squash in a 9x13-inch microwave-safe dish, cut-side down. Pour water into the dish so it is at least 1/2 inch deep.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/wdQWggmYn6fGsrsZQXAzFsXLe-o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282385-microwave-spaghetti-squash-ddmfs-step5-a38a6f3b3bd8459b9c6141affc0baf21.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282385/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave on High until skin is soft and can be pierced with a fork, 12 to 15 minutes. If the dish is too big to rotate, turn off the turntable and rotate the dish halfway through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yDTXMz4P-j8OoUpGn6033SvRJb4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282385-microwave-spaghetti-squash-ddmfs-step6-14d69bec7e4848c8a064b9e612a8918a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282385/step_04.webp"
    }
